542 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 543 0 R/Alt(A log-log plot of N, the mode's time constants spent inside its half-power bandwidth, against frequency from 5 to 500 Hz, for a Q of 50. Four straight parallel lines rise with frequency: 0.5 octaves a minute (blue solid line, circles), 1 octave a minute (orange dashed line, squares), 2 octaves a minute (green dash-dot line, triangles) and 4 octaves a minute (purple dotted line, diamonds). A horizontal gray band below N = 2 is labeled "N under 2: the mode does not settle; its peak comes late and low". A dashed black horizontal line at N = 3.5 is labeled "ISO 7626-2 limit, N = 3.5". At 40 Hz the lines read 8.7, 4.3, 2.2 and 1.1.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 1004 0 R>>
endobj
